# Mod Player v2.5 (DJ Crack / AREAsoft) playing gameover.mod on the General Sound of the card
describe Real-program trace (CL-2): Mod Player v2.5 (mplv2_5.trd), General Sound MOD player, module "gameover"
describe Pentagon 128 with zxbus.1 = multisound; RUN "M_PLv2.5"; the player cold-starts the GS (#F4), asks its
describe RAM size (#20), lists the disk's MODs, uploads the chosen one through #B3 and plays it
machine pentagon128k
cpu 3.5
disk gs/mplv2_5.trd
trdos RUN "M_PLv2.5"
frames 260
key a 15
frames 100
key a 5
key a 5
key a 5
key a 5
key a 5
key a 5
shot gs-modplayer-list
key space 5
frames 150
shot gs-modplayer-playing
save gs-modplayer
